            <ArticleTitle>Complete and Assembled Genome Sequence of Vagococcus teuberi DSM 21459T, a Novel Species Isolated from Fermented Cow Milk in Mali.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01514-16</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01514-16</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The genome of Vagococcus teuberi DSM 21459T, a strain isolated from Malian fermented milk, was sequenced using single-molecule real-time sequencing. The genome of V. teuberi DSM 21459T is the first sequenced genome of this novel species and the second genome among the genus Vagococcus.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>Copyright © 2017 Stevens et al.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
